;
L00,Brake Electronics - Bosch 5.3 (J104) Login
L01,See Factory Repair Manual for proper Login/Coding Information.
L02, 
L03,Note: After Login/Coding-II has been carried out you need to recode the Control Module.
L04, 
L05,40168 = Basic Settings Enabling (i.e. mandatory prior to Steering Angle Sensor Alignment)
