;
C00,Brake Electronics - Bosch 5.3 (J104) Coding
C01,See Factory Repair Manual for proper Login/Coding Information.
C02, 
C03,Note #1: Coding is accepted after a specific Login has been carried out.
C04,Note #2: After successful Coding the Steering Angle Sensor Alignment needs to be carried out.
